<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 1em;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .order-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .order-table th, .order-table td {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .order-table th {
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="content">
            <p>{!customerName},</p>
            <p><strong>Apologies, your recent order did not process successfully. Our service team at Mosaic is actively working behind the scenes to resolve the issue and will reply to you promptly.</strong></p>

            <p>If you have urgent questions, please feel free to contact your SSR directly.</p>
            <p>Thank you for your patience and understanding.</p>
            <p>Internal ref: {!OrderNumber}</p>
            <br>
            <p>Please, do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>